"(0-23).</td></tr>"
"<tr>"
"<td><b>PH</b></td>"
"<td>The hour as a decimal number using a 12-hour clock "
"(01-12).</td></tr>"
"<tr>"
"<td><b>pH</b></td>"
"<td>The hour (12-hour clock) as a decimal number "
"(1-12).</td></tr>"
"<tr>"
"<td><b>MM</b></td>"
"<td>The minutes as a decimal number "
"(00-59).</td>"
"<tr>"
"<tr>"
"<td><b>SS</b></td>"
"<td>The seconds as a decimal number "
"(00-59).</td></tr>"
"<tr>"
"<td><b>AMPM</b></td>"
"<td>Either \"am\" or \"pm\" according to the given time valuẹ Noon is "
"treated as \"pm\" and midnight as \"am\".</td></tr></table>"

